---
// Fondo fijo: rejilla de puntos, dos halos que flotan y una linea de luz arriba.
---
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="dots-bg absolute inset-0 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_90%_55%_at_50%_0%,#000_10%,transparent_70%)]"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-56 left-1/2 h-[560px] w-[900px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent/15 blur-[140px] animate-float"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-32 -right-40 h-[420px] w-[520px] rounded-full bg-accent-2/[0.07] blur-[120px] animate-float-2"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/25 to-transparent"></div>
</div>
